{"id":"wb-7-167","name":"鲻山遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"鲻山遗址","text":"鲻山遗址是浙江省余姚市境内的一处新石器时代遗址，位于丈亭镇西岙村境内，面积约5000平方米，考古文化为河姆渡文化，面积、堆积、文化面貌与河姆渡遗址相近。1981年和1996年，考古学家对鲻山遗址进行了两次发掘，发现了之前浙江省内从未大量发现的新石器时代打制石器，出土的陶器证实了河姆渡遗址各文化层的整体性。2013年3月，鲻山遗址被列入全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%B2%BB%E5%B1%B1%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":84936073,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=84936073","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ae23f772049aac481c76ea8e.jpg","title":"Zishan_Site,_2018-10-06_02.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zishan_Site,_2018-10-06_02.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/Zishan_Site%2C_2018-10-06_02.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Siyuwj","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​余姚鲻山遗址","width":320,"height":214}}